# urirun-connector-urivision

Native `urivision://` URI surface over [urivision/VURI](../../if-uri/urivision): run a `.vuri` process into a DecisionCard (decision + evidence). The decision layer of the perception stack (vdisplay=env, vql=structure, urivision=decision).

See `../urirun/docs/URI_NATIVE_CONNECTOR_CHECKLIST.md`.
